      "exclude": [
        "**/agents/**",
        "skills/taste-skill/evals/**",
        "skills/taste-skill/scripts/**",
        "skills/taste-skill/library/**"
      ],
      "notes": "`evals/`, `scripts/` and `library/` are not vendored. The scripts read keys from the environment and fetch from the network, and two library files are over 256 KB, which holds a plugin for manual review in the Anthropic directory. Without them taste-skill's dealt direction and gate scripts do not run; the direction gate in `skills/anti-slop/SKILL.md` takes their place, and the references (type, colour, layout, imagery, app screens, copy, critique, tells) are kept. Use the upstream repo for the scripts."
    },
